g.webp","alt":"Home Delivery","width":0,"height":0}},"title":"Deepcool GAMMAXX AG500 ARGB Cpu Cooler","stats":[{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Special Price : 2,900৳","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Regular Price : 3,500৳","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Product ID : 343","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"product-stock in-stock","label":"Status:","value":"In Stock","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-manufacturer","label":"Brands:","value":"DeepCool","href":"/deepcool","plain":false},{"cls":"product-model","label":"Model:","value":"AG500 ARGB","href":null,"plain":false}],"minimum":"","price":{"new":"2,900৳","old":"3,500৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax: 2,900৳","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"343","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Supported Socket: Intel: LGA1700 / 1200 / 1151 / 1150 / 1155, AMD: AM5 / AM4","c":[]},{"h":"Fan Size:120mm x 120mm x 25mm","c":[]},{"h":"Airflow:\tUp to 67.88 CFM","c":[]},{"h":"Bearing Type:\tFluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB)","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty : 1 year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h2>Deepcool GAMMAXX AG500 ARGB CPU Air Cooler – High-Performance Cooling with Dazzling ARGB</h2><p>The Deepcool GAMMAXX AG500 ARGB is designed for gamers, PC enthusiasts, and creators who need powerful cooling and brilliant lighting. With advanced heat dissipation technology, wide CPU socket compatibility, and stunning ARGB effects, this cooler ensures your CPU stays cool under pressure while your setup looks spectacular.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Optimized Dual Heat Pipe Design – Two 6mm direct-contact heat pipes rapidly transfer heat away from the CPU, maintaining optimal temperatures.</li><li>High-Performance 120mm PWM Fan – Delivers powerful airflow with minimal noise; adjusts speed automatically based on system load.</li><li>ARGB Lighting System – Customizable addressable RGB LEDs sync seamlessly with ASUS Aura Sync, MSI Mystic Light, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, and ASRock Polychrome RGB.</li><li>Universal Socket Support – Compatible with the latest Intel and AMD platforms.</li><li>Easy Installation – Includes a sturdy mounting kit and thermal paste for quick setup.</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>Specifications:</h3><ul><li>CPU Socket Support:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Intel: LGA1700 / 1200 / 1151 / 1150 / 1155</li><li>AMD: AM5 / AM4</li><li>Heat Pipes:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2 x 6mm direct-touch copper pipes</li><li>Fan Size:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>120mm x 120mm x 25mm</li><li>Fan Speed:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>500 – 2000 RPM ±10% (PWM controlled)</li><li>Airflow:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Up to 67.88 CFM</li><li>Noise Level:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>≤ 29.2 dB(A)</li><li>Bearing Type:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB)</li><li>Lighting<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Addressable RGB (5V 3-pin ARGB)</li><li>TDP Rating:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Up to 220W</li><li>Dimensions:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>125mm x 92mm x 150mm (L x W x H)</li><li>Weight :&nbsp; Approx. 861g</li><li>Compatibility<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Mid-Tower ATX and larger cases</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"DeepCool LS720S ZERO DARK 360mm Liquid CPU Cooler","href":"/deepcool-ls720s-zero-dark-360mm-liquid-cpu-cooler","now":"11,700৳","old":"12,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Deepcool AK500 120mm Single Tower CPU Cooler","href":"/deepcool-ak500-120mm-single-tower-cpu-cooler","now":"5,200৳","old":"5,320৳","single":""},{"name":"Deepcool AK500 WH 120mm Single Tower CPU Cooler","href":"/deepcool-ak500-wh-120mm-